        "narrative": "02\u00a0h\n\n\u03b2\u2212\n\n242Cm\n\n\n\u03b5\n\n242Pu\n\n\n242m1Am\n\nsynth\n\n141\u00a0y\n\nIT\n\n242Am\n\n\n\u03b1\n\n238Np\n\n\n243Am\n\nsynth\n\n7350\u00a0y\n\n\u03b1\n\n239Np\n\n\nSF\n\n\u2013\n\n\u00a0Category: Americiumviewtalkedit | references\nAmericium is a synthetic chemical element; it has symbol Am and atomic number 95.",
